# Patrol Checklist System · Environment Config
# ============================================

# Get these from your Supabase project:
# Settings -> API -> Project URL + anon public key
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Key roles:
# - anon key: Used client-side, restricted by RLS policies
# - service_role key: Server/admin use only, never expose publicly
#
# Usage:
# 1. Copy this file as .env
# 2. Fill in your Supabase URL and anon key
# 3. Or edit SUPABASE_CONFIG in js/supabase-client.js directly
#
# .env must NOT be committed to Git (listed in .gitignore).
# Each developer uses their own Supabase project.